  "title": "Ottoman Empire",
  "summary": "The Ottoman Empire is dated 1299 to 1922 and was founded by Osman, an Anatolian chieftain. Bursa became its capital in 1326, and Mehmed II took Constantinople on 29 May 1453, which then became the capital. At its peak in the 16th and 17th centuries it held Anatolia, the Balkans, Syria, Egypt and parts of Arabia and North Africa. The sultanate was abolished on 1 November 1922.",
